; Modular ERB: OMOGATARI/ITEM/Armory/300 Firearms/300 Pistols.ERB
; Melee is done by Tatara, Kappas, or by locals
; Most renaissance and earlier guns and bows are reproductions by locals with no machining equipment
; Industrial revolution to World War 2 era weapons are either gapped/smuggled or replicated by Kappas and Rika
; Midworld weapons are 95% to be replicas. There is the occasional gapped or smuggled gun however by either outsider military personnel or to be studied on.
; Spacer weapons are either Lunarian made or imported from the Seihou world (via the occasional Cactus Company ship or VIVIT android that comes)
; All Ultratech weapons are Makai made
; No archotech weapons exist yet
;The SLICER is Gensou-chan's experiment on a self-replicating sword. With the power of an in-built (and self-regenerating) Youjutsu tank, the user can throw the sword and have it replicate itself near instantly. Thrown copies are destroyed upon impact for safety. The SLICER also enjoys Gensou-chan's usual enhancements such as a dynamically heating blade that slices through anything when red hot, as well as comfortable HUG series grips.
;The Ender has no abreviation. Its 20mm APFSDS spike is fed into 37mm shells,
;Yojipowder. Raw Youjutsu essence grounded down into a powder. Commonly extracted from the excretions of mages and Youjutsu bearers, it can also be extracted from saliva, semen, or vaginal fluid as well. Yojipowder is commonly used as a very powerful (around 8x stronger than gunpowder) propellent for firearms as well as making potions more powerful, and enhancing items with magic. 1 gram of Yojipowder (around 15 grains) is equivalent to 100 MP.
